'''Dismay''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] that causes enemies to flee from you. It can hit any enemies in its radius, similar to [[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]].

{{NewLeft}}
==Possible Uses==
*Occupying several weaker enemies to make way for a stronger foe.
*Lessening the odds against yourself when outnumbered.
*Clearing the way to flee out of a difficult situation.
*Buying time to safely transform into a [[Skyrim:Werewolf|Werewolf]] or [[Skyrim:Vampire Lord|Vampire Lord]].

{{NewLine}}

