== Notes ==
* Although its effects are similar to that of [[Skyrim:Fear (effect)|Fear]] spells, Dismay is ''not'' governed by the [[Skyrim:Illusion|Illusion]] skill and does not benefit from any perks. It also does not affect undead, Daedra, machines, or dragons.


